+ * 0.53 s after it starts that lie inside the mcc register apertures, in its order,
+ * MEASURED under the hypervisor (recording from entry): both AMCCs' plane enables built
+ * bit by bit, each after a 0xff000000000 configuration word, and the stage words with
+ * their range words. iBoot leaves them at 0. Left out: the region-lock (ctrr) words
+ * (Linux arms no lock) and the lane tables of the DCS channel pages, which lie outside
+ * the apertures. 119 of macOS's 403 writes. Physical address, width in bytes, value.
+ */
+#ifndef __MCC_T8132_ENTRY_H__
+#define __MCC_T8132_ENTRY_H__
